---
import { renderMermaidSVG } from 'beautiful-mermaid';
import type { Lang } from '../i18n';
interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
const title = en ? 'Multi-agent architecture' : 'Multi-agentarchitectuur';
const diagram = `flowchart TD
  request["${en ? 'Ticket / request' : 'Ticket / vraag'}"] --> chat["LibreChat"]
  chat -->|OpenAI-compatible API| proxy["A2A proxy"]
  proxy -->|A2A| planner["Planner"]
  planner -->|A2A| wfoAgent["WFO agent"]
  planner -->|A2A| inventoryAgent["Inventory agent"]
  planner -->|A2A| networkAgent["Network agent"]
  wfoAgent -->|MCP| wfo["Workflow Orchestrator"]
  inventoryAgent -->|MCP| netboxMcp["netbox-mcp"]
  netboxMcp -->|API| netbox["NetBox"]
  networkAgent -->|MCP| networkMcp["network-mcp"]
  networkMcp -->|REST + GraphQL| wfo
  networkMcp -->|JSON-RPC| lab["SR Linux: Amsterdam ↔ Paris ↔ London"]
`;
const svg = renderMermaidSVG(diagram, {
  bg: 'transparent', fg: '#f5f0e8', accent: '#6c5ce7', muted: '#8884aa',
});
---
<figure class="setup">
  <figcaption>{title}</figcaption>
  <div class="diagram" role="img" aria-label={en ? 'LibreChat routes requests through an A2A proxy to a planner. The planner delegates over A2A to WFO, inventory and network agents, which use MCP tools. The inventory agent queries NetBox through netbox-mcp. The network agent calls network-mcp, which reads WFO intent over REST and GraphQL and SR Linux over JSON-RPC. The containerlab network connects Amsterdam, Paris and London without an alternate path.' : 'LibreChat stuurt vragen via een A2A-proxy naar een planner. De planner schakelt via A2A de WFO-, inventory- en network-agents in. Zij gebruiken MCP-tools. De inventory-agent bevraagt NetBox via netbox-mcp. De network-agent gebruikt network-mcp, dat WFO-configuratie via REST en GraphQL ophaalt en SR Linux via JSON-RPC uitleest. Het containerlab-netwerk verbindt Amsterdam, Parijs en Londen zonder alternatief pad.'}>
    <Fragment set:html={svg} />
  </div>
  <p>{en ? 'A2A connects specialist agents; MCP exposes tools. WFO stores service intent. The network-mcp server reads it via REST and GraphQL and queries SR Linux over JSON-RPC; netbox-mcp provides inventory access. The three-node containerlab network has no alternate path.' : 'A2A verbindt gespecialiseerde agents; MCP ontsluit tools. WFO bewaart de serviceconfiguratie. De network-mcp-server leest die via REST en GraphQL en bevraagt SR Linux via JSON-RPC; netbox-mcp ontsluit inventarisgegevens. Het containerlab-netwerk met drie nodes heeft geen alternatief pad.'}</p>
</figure>
<style>
  .setup { margin: 0; padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid rgba(108,92,231,.22); border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(18,18,42,.7); }
  figcaption { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .diagram { overflow-x: auto; }
  .diagram :global(svg) { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 760px; min-width: 540px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; }
  p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: .75rem 0 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .setup { padding: 1rem; } }
</style>
